"use strict";(self.webpackChunkknowledge_graph_plugin=self.webpackChunkknowledge_graph_plugin||[]).push([[6285],{19192(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"archive":{"blogPosts":[{"id":"/2026/04/09/homepage-rewrite","metadata":{"permalink":"/knowledge-graph/docs-updates/2026/04/09/homepage-rewrite","source":"@site/docs-updates/2026-04-09-homepage-rewrite.mdx","title":"Home page redesigned - clearer audience, context grid, demo GIF","description":"The KMGraph home page has been redesigned based on user feedback. The previous page didn\'t immediately answer who KMGraph is for or what it does - visitors had to read too far before the value was clear.","date":"2026-04-09T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"docs","permalink":"/knowledge-graph/docs-updates/tags/docs"},{"inline":true,"label":"ux","permalink":"/knowledge-graph/docs-updates/tags/ux"},{"inline":true,"label":"homepage","permalink":"/knowledge-graph/docs-updates/tags/homepage"}],"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Marc Kaplan","url":"https://github.com/technomensch","imageURL":"https://github.com/technomensch.png","key":"technomensch","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Home page redesigned - clearer audience, context grid, demo GIF","authors":["technomensch"],"tags":["docs","ux","homepage"],"date":"2026-04-09T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"nextItem":{"title":"Documentation restructured \u2014 Di\xe1taxis IA, search, demos","permalink":"/knowledge-graph/docs-updates/2026/04/08/docusaurus-restructure"}},"content":"The KMGraph home page has been redesigned based on user feedback. The previous page didn\'t immediately answer who KMGraph is for or what it does - visitors had to read too far before the value was clear.\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n## What changed\\n\\n**New banner** - updated to lead with the audience hook, the problem, and the solution in a single visual:\\n- *\\"Using an AI coding assistant? KMGraph is for you.\\"*\\n- *\\"KMGraph remembers what you and your tools forget.\\"*\\n- *\\"Lessons Learned. Decisions. Institutional Knowledge.\\"*\\n\\n**Context grid** - a 2\xd72 grid immediately answers \\"what does it bridge?\\": sessions, models, tools, and teammates.\\n\\n**What it stores** - three plain-language bullets mapping directly to the tricolon: lessons learned, decisions, and institutional knowledge.\\n\\n**Audience badges** - explicit audience callout: Developer \xb7 Vibe-Coder \xb7 Prompt Engineer \xb7 Open-Source Maintainer \xb7 Small Agile Team.\\n\\n**Demo GIF** - `capture-lesson` demo now shown on the home page so visitors see the tool in action before being asked to install it."},{"id":"/2026/04/08/docusaurus-restructure","metadata":{"permalink":"/knowledge-graph/docs-updates/2026/04/08/docusaurus-restructure","source":"@site/docs-updates/2026-04-08-docusaurus-restructure.mdx","title":"Documentation restructured \u2014 Di\xe1taxis IA, search, demos","description":"The KMGraph documentation site has been fully restructured using the Di\xe1taxis information architecture: Tutorials, How-to Guides, Reference, and Concepts. Every page now has a clear intent, and navigation reflects what you\'re trying to do \u2014 not internal feature groupings.","date":"2026-04-08T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"docs","permalink":"/knowledge-graph/docs-updates/tags/docs"},{"inline":true,"label":"ux","permalink":"/knowledge-graph/docs-updates/tags/ux"},{"inline":true,"label":"docusaurus","permalink":"/knowledge-graph/docs-updates/tags/docusaurus"}],"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Marc Kaplan","url":"https://github.com/technomensch","imageURL":"https://github.com/technomensch.png","key":"technomensch","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Documentation restructured \u2014 Di\xe1taxis IA, search, demos","authors":["technomensch"],"tags":["docs","ux","docusaurus"],"date":"2026-04-08T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Home page redesigned - clearer audience, context grid, demo GIF","permalink":"/knowledge-graph/docs-updates/2026/04/09/homepage-rewrite"},"nextItem":{"title":"Homepage visuals, UX improvements, and doc fixes","permalink":"/knowledge-graph/docs-updates/github-docs-visuals"}},"content":"The KMGraph documentation site has been fully restructured using the [Di\xe1taxis](https://diataxis.fr) information architecture: Tutorials, How-to Guides, Reference, and Concepts. Every page now has a clear intent, and navigation reflects what you\'re trying to do \u2014 not internal feature groupings.\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n## What changed\\n\\n**New structure**\\n\\n- **Quickstart** \u2014 zero-to-first-lesson in 5 minutes with terminal demo GIFs\\n- **15 how-to guides** \u2014 task-oriented recipes: capture from a bugfix, write a pattern, sync across machines, integrate with Obsidian/Notion/NotebookLM, and more\\n- **Reference** \u2014 commands, skills, agents, hooks, and templates in sortable tables; condensed from the old COMMAND-GUIDE\\n- **Concepts** \u2014 explanatory pages for the mental models behind KMGraph (why it exists, the four pillars, personal vs project KGs, the automation layer)\\n\\n**Demo GIFs**\\n\\nEvery core command now has a VHS terminal recording embedded in the Quickstart page: `init`, `status`, `recall`, `capture-lesson`, and `session-summary`.\\n\\n**Search**\\n\\nFull-text search is active via `@orama/plugin-docusaurus-v3` \u2014 no crawler required.\\n\\n**Glossary tooltips**\\n\\nKMGraph-specific terms (lesson, ADR, KG, skill, agent, capture, recall, session, handoff, hook, pattern) now show definition tooltips on hover via the new `<Glossary>` component.\\n\\n## Files removed\\n\\nThe following legacy pages were split into the new structure and removed:\\n\\n- `GETTING-STARTED.md` \u2192 Quickstart + Troubleshooting + reference/agents + reference/skills\\n- `CHANGELOG-DOCS-ONLY.md` \u2192 seeded into this `docs-updates/` feed\\n- `_test-layout.md`, `DEPLOYMENT-SITEMAP.md`, `NAVIGATION-INDEX.md` \u2014 orphaned, removed"},{"id":"github-docs-visuals","metadata":{"permalink":"/knowledge-graph/docs-updates/github-docs-visuals","source":"@site/docs-updates/2026-02-26-github-docs-visuals.mdx","title":"Homepage visuals, UX improvements, and doc fixes","description":"Initial documentation site improvements: homepage journey flow diagram, expanded scenarios, and accessibility fixes.","date":"2026-02-26T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"visuals","permalink":"/knowledge-graph/docs-updates/tags/visuals"},{"inline":true,"label":"ux","permalink":"/knowledge-graph/docs-updates/tags/ux"},{"inline":true,"label":"accessibility","permalink":"/knowledge-graph/docs-updates/tags/accessibility"}],"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Marc Kaplan","url":"https://github.com/technomensch","imageURL":"https://github.com/technomensch.png","key":"technomensch","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"slug":"github-docs-visuals","title":"Homepage visuals, UX improvements, and doc fixes","authors":"technomensch","tags":["visuals","ux","accessibility"],"date":"2026-02-26T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Documentation restructured \u2014 Di\xe1taxis IA, search, demos","permalink":"/knowledge-graph/docs-updates/2026/04/08/docusaurus-restructure"}},"content":"Initial documentation site improvements: homepage journey flow diagram, expanded scenarios, and accessibility fixes.\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n## Homepage Visuals & UX\\n\\n- **Journey Flow Mermaid Diagram**: Replaced bulleted scenarios with a narrative left-to-right flow.\\n- **Expanded Scenarios**: Added trigger moments and future payoffs (including agile sprint retrospectives).\\n- **\\"About This Project\\" Repositioning**: Moved project backstory to the bottom of the page in a collapsed info box.\\n- **\\"How It Works\\" Concrete Rewrite**: Clarified markdown-based storage and absence of external database dependencies.\\n- **Feature Discoverability**: Set the full feature list to be open by default.\\n- **Intro Sentence**: Added a guiding sentence before the journey flow diagram.\\n- **Typography**: Removed emdashes from descriptive text for a cleaner documentation style.\\n\\n## General Documentation Updates\\n\\n- **Universal Installer Clarification**: Added details to `GETTING-STARTED.md` regarding behavioral expectations and terminal/file access requirements.\\n- **Fragment Links & Anchors**: Fixed broken internal navigation links in `COMMAND-GUIDE.md` and `NAVIGATION-INDEX.md`.\\n- **Accessibility Fixes**: Added `accTitle` and `accDescr` to all new diagrams for Section 508 compliance.\\n- **Typo Fix**: Corrected missing space in `index.md` Outcome card."}]}}')}}]);